WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.580
Democratic Senator Bernie Sanders, who you
probably know is also running for president.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:11.500
The 20 is now calling for the House of Representatives
to immediately start an impeachment inquiry

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.599
into Donald Trump.

00:00:12.599 --> 00:00:16.660
And despite the fact that what he wants is
an impeachment inquiry, there have been a

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:22.190
ton of posts and discussions and comments
online, which initially said Bernie is calling

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.880
for Trump's removal.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.730
And that's just not what Bernie did.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:31.160
Bernie is calling for the removal of Trump
by voting him out in 2020.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.470
That's one way that Bernie Sanders is saying
Donald Trump should be removed, but Bernie

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:38.900
Sanders has only called for the beginning
of an impeachment inquiry.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.000
That's step one in the impeachment process.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.710
Uh, interestingly, this happened at a campaign
rally late last week.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:48.390
It was not mentioned for days by media outlets.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:53.190
And when it was initially mentioned, a lot
of the reaction to the story was completely

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:56.050
misunderstanding what it is that Bernie Sanders
said.

00:00:56.050 --> 00:01:00.160
So this is the right call that Bernie Sanders
is making.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:05.189
And Bernie Sanders, like the David Pakman
show like other shows, we all realize that

00:01:05.189 --> 00:01:09.130
the Republican Senate is not going to convict
Donald Trump and actually remove him from

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.170
office.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:15.159
But the fact support starting an impeachment
inquiry period.

00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:16.970
And that's why I'm glad Bernie's doing this.

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:22.499
He said at this rally in Henderson, Nevada,
uh, quote, I believe the House Judiciary Committee

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.590
should begin impeachment inquiries.

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:30.389
That is inquiries not impeachment to determine
whether or not Trump has committed impeachable

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:31.569
offenses.

00:01:31.569 --> 00:01:37.009
This is an important change, not because Bernie
saying it will make impeachment more of a

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:43.240
reality more quickly, but because it's starting
to become a distraction, does burning not

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.959
think there should be an impeachment inquiry?

00:01:45.959 --> 00:01:47.119
What's wrong with Bernie?

00:01:47.119 --> 00:01:48.880
Why isn't Bernie willing to say it?

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.200
Well now Bernie Sanders has made it clear
that he supports an impeachment inquiry, but

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:57.829
I've got to make the same statement again
that I've been saying for awhile and impeachment

00:01:57.829 --> 00:02:01.259
inquiry is not impeachment and impeachment
is not removal.

00:02:01.259 --> 00:02:02.259
Okay?

00:02:02.259 --> 00:02:08.709
The process is inquiry during which there
is testimony, investigation, debate by the

00:02:08.709 --> 00:02:09.709
house.

00:02:09.709 --> 00:02:15.060
If they determine that impeachment articles
should be filed, those articles are then filed

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.140
by the house.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:22.610
They require a majority simple majority, 50%
plus one of the four and 35 house members.

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:26.370
Then there is a trial of sorts that the house
puts forward.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:30.640
All of the evidence they believe supports
the impeachment of the president, at which

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:34.519
point the Senate votes on whether to convict
and remove the president or not.

00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:37.489
Uh, and to convict, you need two thirds of
the Senate.

00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:41.330
All we're talking about here, all that Bernie
Sanders is talking about is an impeachment

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.330
inquiry.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.909
So there are a whole bunch of wrong reactions
to this news.

00:02:44.909 --> 00:02:50.290
The first wrong reaction to this news is that,
uh, many have said, oh, Bernie's calling for

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:51.440
the removal of Trump.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.019
But that's not what he's doing.

00:02:53.019 --> 00:02:54.019
It's just not.

00:02:54.019 --> 00:02:55.019
It's wrong in two ways.

00:02:55.019 --> 00:02:58.440
Number one, Bernie's just calling for the
inquiry, which happens before impeachment

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:00.129
articles or even filed.

00:03:00.129 --> 00:03:04.469
And number two, even impeachment by the house
wouldn't remove Trump.

00:03:04.469 --> 00:03:07.959
Only a conviction by the Senate would remove
Trump and it's not gonna happen.

00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:08.959
Okay?

00:03:08.959 --> 00:03:09.959
That's not the point.

00:03:09.959 --> 00:03:14.040
The point is we want to expose what Trump
has done and potentially we can him in 2020

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:19.400
there are others who are reacting to this
saying, Bernie, so weak, he's riding the fence.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.370
He's only calling for an inquiry.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:24.090
He should just buckle down and call for impeachment.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.620
It's a silly criticism.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.620
Bernie's a senator.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:31.099
Bernie would conceivably be one of the people
voting on the trial that would be brought

00:03:31.099 --> 00:03:33.049
forth by these articles of impeachment.

00:03:33.049 --> 00:03:38.680
If they were ever filed, it would be in a
sense inappropriate for Bernie to say, now

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.760
we must remove Trump.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:45.250
What most senators have been saying, uh, is
that they believe either an inquiry should

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:48.090
start or that the house should file articles.

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:52.870
Uh, and then later the Senate would ultimately
be making the decision about how do they want

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.939
to vote and do they get that two thirds support.

00:03:54.939 --> 00:03:56.870
So Bernie is 100% correct here.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.360
He's saying do the inquiry.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.060
That's the required first step.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.060
It's great news.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.540
Maybe it will put more pressure on people
like Nancy Pelosi who have been sort of hesitant

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.239
to consider impeachment.

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:12.261
Uh, and Bernie Sanders is, you know, some
people will criticize him for this, but I

00:04:12.261 --> 00:04:16.600
believe that, uh, the net positive benefit
of him just saying this and getting it out

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:18.220
of the way, make sense.

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:19.300
I'm glad he did it.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.300
I agree.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.250
Let's start that inquiry as soon as humanly
possible.

